  "name": "ToF-360",
  "identifier": "10.57967/hf/5074",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tToF-360 Dataset\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThe ToF-360 dataset consists of spherical RGB-D images with instance-level semantic and room layout annotations, which include 4 unique scenes. It contains 179 equirectangular RGB images along with the corresponding depths, surface normals, XYZ images, and HHA images, labeled with building-defining object categories and image based layout boundaries (ceiling-wall, wall-floor). The dataset enables development of scene understanding tasks based on\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/COLE-Ricoh/ToF-360.",
